SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Pool swim 45 min\, ~1\,500m easy aerobic
  with 400m technique d
DESCRIPTION:Pool swim 45 min\, ~1\,500m easy aerobic with 400m technique dr
 ills (catch-up\, fingertip drag) + 4×100m at 2:20–2:30/100m — reduce 
 volume gate to 1\,500m given 4-week swim absence\; prioritise stroke feel 
 over distance.\n\nReason: No pool swimming has been recorded in 4 weeks an
 d open-water sessions were short (max 2km OW on July 13)\, so jumping stra
 ight to 2\,000m+ risks form breakdown and shoulder overuse — build back 
 in with 1\,500m before returning to full volume the following week.\n\nAI 
 coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
